+    /**
+     * An empty paragraph that holds a measured gap open, {@code gapTw} twips tall.
+     *
+     * <p>The height is written as {@code w:before} with a one-twip box, NOT as {@code w:line}.
+     * The two engines read a line box differently and this is the one paragraph where the two
+     * readings can be made to agree:
+     *
+     * <pre>
+     *   Word / LibreOffice  height = w:before + w:line/20
+     *   Google Docs         height = w:before + max((w:line/240)*lineHeight(face,size),
+     *                                               0.069*size)
+     * </pre>
+     *
+     * <p>They are equal when {@code w:line/20 == 0.069*size}, i.e. {@code w:line == 1.38*size}.
+     * The gap paragraph's only run is the 1 pt paragraph mark ({@code <w:sz w:val="2"/>}), so
+     * that value is 1.38 twips and 1 twip is within 0.02 pt of it. Written the old way - all of
+     * the gap in {@code w:line} - Google reads 13.8 pt of white space as 1.15 x lineHeight of a
+     * 1 pt run and gives back about 1.3 pt, and everything below the gap rises by the rest.
+     *
+     * <p>Measured on 362_price_list_dense: the 276-twip gap above its table came out 13.8 pt in
+     * LibreOffice and ~1.3 pt under Google's own formula, so the table and its 256 runs sat
+     * about 12.5 pt high. That document's 20_within_10pt is 1 %, and 2 of its 258 runs are above
+     * the gap. The one-twip box is the only place the two models coincide, which is why the fix
+     * belongs here and not in the flowing-line box.
+     */
+    private static void gapPara(StringBuilder sb, int gapTw) {
+        int line = 1;
+        int before = Math.max(0, gapTw - line);
+        sb.append("<w:p><w:pPr><w:snapToGrid w:val=\"0\"/>")
+                .append("<w:spacing w:beforeAutospacing=\"0\" w:afterAutospacing=\"0\" w:before=\"")
+                .append(before)
+                .append("\" w:after=\"0\" w:line=\"")
+                .append(line)
+                .append("\" w:lineRule=\"exact\"/>")
+                .append("<w:rPr><w:sz w:val=\"2\"/></w:rPr></w:pPr></w:p>");
+    }
+
     /** The paragraph a table must be followed by: 4 pt, in twips. */
     private static final int POST_TABLE_TW = 80;
 
